{"unit_id":"tag:04SS:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>，<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的纤维群胚范畴（category fibred in groupoids）。我们将经常使用<MATH_0004>-米田引理（Yoneda lemma），见《范畴（Categories）》引理<REF_0001>。严格地说，它断言存在范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATH_0005>\n它说明<MATH_0006>-态射（morphisms）<MATH_0007>与对象（objects）<MATH_0008>相对应，后者属于纤维范畴（category）<MATH_0009>。具体而言，给定<MATH_0010>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>，我们得到对象（object）<MATH_0012>。反之，为<MATH_0013>选择拉回（pullbacks），如《范畴（Categories）》定义<REF_0002>所述，再给定对象（object）<MATH_0014>，它属于<MATH_0015>，则得到函子（functor）<MATH_0016>，它在对象（objects）上由规则\n<MATH_0017>\n定义。我们滥用记号，写作\n<MATH_0018>\n以表示此函子（functor）。它确实具有性质<MATH_0019>；此外，给定任意另一个函子（functor）<MATH_0020>满足<MATH_0021>，则存在唯一的<MATH_0022>-同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0023>。换言之，函子（functor）<MATH_0024>由对象（object）<MATH_0025>确定，精确到唯一的<MATH_0026>-同构（isomorphism）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n下文将使用这一点，不再另行说明。\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴"},{"source_term":"Yoneda lemma","target_term":"米田引理"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴","context":"以群胚为纤维的范畴。"},{"source_term":"Yoneda lemma","target_term":"米田引理","context":"2-米田引理。"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"被引用章节。"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"米田对应的范畴等价。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"1-态射。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定的1-态射。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"纤维范畴及函子的对象。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"确定函子的纤维对象。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"纤维范畴。"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回","context":"为纤维范畴选择拉回。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"由对象构造的函子。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"唯一的2-同构；各词条待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04ST:title","translation":"以群胚（groupoids）为纤维的范畴（categories）的可表（Representable）态射（morphisms）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"纤维的类型。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"以群胚为纤维的范畴。"},{"source_term":"Representable","target_term":"可表","context":"态射的可表性。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"纤维范畴之间的态射；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04ST:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上以群胚（groupoids）为纤维的范畴（categories）。设<MATH_0004>为一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>可表的（representable）<MATH_0005>-态射（morphism）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，见《范畴（Categories）》定义<REF_0001>。这意味着，对每个<MATH_0006>及任意<MATH_0007>，<MATH_0008>-纤维积（fibre product）\n<MATH_0009>\n是可表的（representable），视为<MATH_0010>上的纤维群胚范畴（category fibred in groupoids）。选择一个表示对象（object）<MATH_0011>及一个等价（equivalence）\n<MATH_0012>\n态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>对应于投影（projection）\n<MATH_0014>\n见第<REF_0002>节的等式（<REF_0003>）。我们用图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0015>\n表示这一点，其中波形箭头（arrows）表示<MATH_0016>-米田嵌入（Yoneda embedding）。下面给出有关这一概念的一些引理，它们在很一般的情形下成立（即对任意具有纤维积（fibre products）的底范畴（category），其上以群胚（groupoids）为纤维的范畴（categories）都适用）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"Yoneda embedding","target_term":"米田嵌入"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"纤维的类型。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"以群胚为纤维的范畴。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"态射及纤维积的可表性。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"纤维范畴间的1-态射。"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"被引用章节。"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积","context":"2-纤维积。"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"底范畴中的纤维积。"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴","context":"表示对象的纤维范畴。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"表示对象。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"表示对象给出的等价。"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"纤维积的投影。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"交换图表。"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头","context":"图表的波形箭头。"},{"source_term":"Yoneda embedding","target_term":"米田嵌入","context":"2-米田嵌入。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"底范畴；各词条待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02ZR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>的态射（morphism）。则由<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism）的诱导构造，对<MATH_0004>所得的\n<MATH_0005>\n是可表的（representable）<MATH_0006>-态射（morphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"概形态射及诱导的1-态射。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"诱导的1-态射的可表性；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
