{"unit_id":"tag:02ZU:proof","translation":"将<MATH_0001>写成复合（composition）\n<MATH_0002>。\n第一个箭头（arrow）是<MATH_0003>沿映射（map）<MATH_0004>的基变换（base change），第二个箭头（arrow）是<MATH_0005>沿映射（map）<MATH_0006>的基变换（base change）。因此，本引理是引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>的形式推论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"将态射写成两个箭头的复合。"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头","context":"该复合的两个箭头。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"基变换所沿的映射。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"复合中的两个基变换；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
