{"unit_id":"tag:04SU:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为包含在<MATH_0002>中的概形（scheme）。回顾，给定一个“群胚（groupoids）预层（presheaf）”\n<MATH_0003>\n便得到纤维群胚范畴（category fibred in groupoids）<MATH_0004>，它在<MATH_0005>上，见《范畴（Categories）》例<REF_0001>。任何与其中一个同构的（isomorphic）（！）纤维群胚范畴（category fibred in groupoids）都称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>分裂纤维群胚范畴（split category fibred in groupoids）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。任何纤维群胚范畴（category fibred in groupoids）都与一个分裂的范畴等价（equivalent）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n若<MATH_0006>是集合（sets）预层（presheaf），则<MATH_0007>以集合（sets）为纤维，见《范畴（Categories）》定义<REF_0002>和《范畴（Categories）》例<REF_0003>。规则<MATH_0008>在某种意义下，在预层（presheaves）上是全忠实的（fully faithful），见《范畴（Categories）》引理<REF_0004>。若<MATH_0009>是预层（presheaves），则\n<MATH_0010>\n若<MATH_0011>及<MATH_0012>是集合预层（presheaves of sets）的映射（maps），则\n<MATH_0013>\n其中右端是<MATH_0014>-纤维积（fibre products）。这直接由定义得出，因为纤维范畴（categories）<MATH_0015>只有恒等态射（identity morphisms）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n一个更特殊的情形是<MATH_0016>为可表的（representable）预层（presheaf）。此时有\n<MATH_0017>，见《范畴（Categories）》例<REF_0005>。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n下文将使用记号<MATH_0018>，不再另行说明。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构的"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴"},{"source_term":"split category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"分裂纤维群胚范畴"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"presheaves of sets","target_term":"集合预层"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"identity morphisms","target_term":"恒等态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"底概形。"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"预层的值。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"群胚、集合及可表预层。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"预层之间的对应。"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维群胚范畴","context":"由群胚预层构造的范畴。"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"被引用章节。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构的","context":"分裂性要求同构。"},{"source_term":"split category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"分裂纤维群胚范畴","context":"本段定义的分裂范畴。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"一般纤维群胚范畴与分裂者等价。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"预层的值和纤维。"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的","context":"预层到纤维范畴的构造。"},{"source_term":"presheaves of sets","target_term":"集合预层","context":"给定映射的定义域和值域。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"集合预层之间的映射。"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"右端的2-纤维积。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"纤维范畴。"},{"source_term":"identity morphisms","target_term":"恒等态射","context":"纤维范畴的态射。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"特殊情形的预层；各词条待决。"}],"notes":[]}
